  "question": {
    "text": "Two sets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are as under:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mtext>and</mtext><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then :",
    "image": null
  },
