  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given sets,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mtext>and</mtext><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mtext>and</mtext><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mtext>and</mtext><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>For set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/86f95aeb-2723-44f2-8d36-9d2f19001c93-image.png\" style=\"width: 265px; height: 237px;\" /></p><p>For corner coordinates of the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>For set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4509ca30-3013-418e-bee8-90e2b47732bf-e0dbeab1-9c71-4364-97d7-4bdd2a7cf983-image.png\" style=\"width: 343px; height: 265px;\" /></p><p>Now, Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>in&nbsp;the equation of the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>lies in the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math><br /><br />Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>also&nbsp;lies in the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8834;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>.</p>",
